{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - On 08/01/2025, the proposed change of use of 16 Windsor Road, Hounslow, TW4 7QQ from Use Class C3(a) to Use Class C3(b) was lawful within the meaning of Section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) because:\nThe proposed use of the property within Use Class C3(b) would fall under the same class as the existing use (Class C3(a)) and as such, as per Article 3(1) of the Use Class Order 1987 (amended), this change of use would not constitute development and therefore planning permission is not required."
